<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Insurance companies started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Insurance companies started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it initiated coverage of several insurance firms.</p>
<p>-- said started Conseco Inc as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said started American General Corp, Provident Cos Inc, and Transamerica Corp with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- said started AmerUs Life Holdings Inc as a hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
